    "title": "Billy Hamilton, Cubs agree to minor league contract - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By James Neveau ,\n6 hours ago The Chicago Cubs have made a quiet addition to their farm system in recent days, signing speedster Billy Hamilton to a minor-league deal. Hamilton, who has not played in an MLB game since the 2023 season, has been recently playing games for Jalisco in the Mexican League, but on the Cubs’ official transaction log for Aug. 31, he inked a minor-league deal with the North Siders. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
